6px;margin:0">All major providers rode the DeepSeek boom, but Volcano Engin=
e emerged as the fastest-growing player, with revenues more than doubling y=
ear-on-year. Why? ByteDance had stockpiled GPUs that once sat idle but sudd=
enly became scarce and valuable, and then also priced them at steep discoun=
ts.</p></li></ul><div style=3D"font-size:16px;line-height:26px;margin:32px =
